WEBVTT

NOTE CineReels — prov-dramabox-42000023968 — Episode 16 — English subtitles
NOTE Transcribed 2026-11-27 from the real episode audio (faster-whisper small).

1
00:00:02.510 --> 00:00:06.470
That old ham actually had the nerve to use dark magic against me?

2
00:00:06.470 --> 00:00:08.970
And you're just as useless.

3
00:00:08.970 --> 00:00:13.130
A so-called ester beast folk, and you couldn't even fight them off?

4
00:00:13.130 --> 00:00:18.660
Go tell the servants.

5
00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:21.460
No supplies are allowed to go to that old hag's place anymore.

6
00:00:21.460 --> 00:00:23.460
Not even scraps dogs wouldn't eat.

7
00:00:23.460 --> 00:00:25.460
That shameless Kasey.

8
00:00:25.460 --> 00:00:28.460
She actually cut off all my food supplies.

9
00:00:28.460 --> 00:00:31.960
I can't keep relying on affinity points that to buy food every time.

10
00:00:31.960 --> 00:00:33.960
What am I supposed to do now?

11
00:00:33.960 --> 00:00:37.470
How'd it go?

12
00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:39.470
Did anyone agree to hire you?

13
00:00:39.470 --> 00:00:41.470
Those spineless cowards!

14
00:00:41.470 --> 00:00:43.470
The second they recognized us, they slammed the door shut like we were the plague!

15
00:00:43.470 --> 00:00:45.470
I asked around.

16
00:00:45.470 --> 00:00:47.470
Kasey's been putting the pressure on everyone.

17
00:00:47.470 --> 00:00:49.470
Anyone who dares to hire us is totally screwed.

18
00:00:49.470 --> 00:00:51.470
Relax.

19
00:00:51.470 --> 00:00:53.470
I'll head into the dark forest outside the capital tonight.

20
00:00:53.470 --> 00:00:56.470
If I can hunt down a high-tier monster, we can sell it for cash.

21
00:00:56.470 --> 00:00:58.470
No! Going out there right now is suicide!

22
00:00:58.470 --> 00:01:02.470
If normal ways won't make money, then I'll have to get creative.

23
00:01:02.470 --> 00:01:04.470
Don't worry about money. I'll handle it.

24
00:01:04.470 --> 00:01:06.470
System, pull up the affinity store.

25
00:01:08.470 --> 00:01:11.470
Affinity store is now open. Please select an item to exchange.

26
00:01:11.470 --> 00:01:15.550
Too expensive.

27
00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:17.550
And none of these can be sold fast enough.

28
00:01:17.550 --> 00:01:22.240
Wait a sec.

29
00:01:22.240 --> 00:01:25.520
I'll take this!

30
00:01:25.520 --> 00:01:27.520
Think you can starve us out?

31
00:01:27.520 --> 00:01:29.520
In your dreams, Kasey.

32
00:01:29.520 --> 00:01:32.520
With this, we're never going broke again!
